  "title": "dumpcap: Do not flush after every packet in pcapng passthrough mode",
  "description": "Flushing after every packet kills the compression ratio when\ncompressing. We need to flush before sending messages on the signal\npipe. The new file notification is done here, so flush for that.\nOtherwise the main loop takes care of necessary flushing.\n\nThe similar method for pcap input, capture_loop_write_packet_cb,\ndoes not flush after each packet.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
